const sourceCode = "import { Callout } from 'nextra/components'\n\n# Framer Plugin\n\nAccess the complete Boxicons library directly within your Framer projects. Search, customize, and insert icons instantly.\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Open Framer.\n2. Navigate to **Plugins** > **Browse Plugins**.\n3. Search for \"Boxicons\".\n4. Click **Install**.\n\n<Callout type=\"info\">\n  Alternatively, visit the [Framer Plugin Store](https://www.framer.com/marketplace/plugins/boxicons-high-quality-web-icons/) to install directly.\n</Callout>\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open a project in Framer.\n2. Launch the Boxicons plugin from the **Plugins** menu.\n3. Browse or search for an icon.\n4. Customize properties like color, size, and style in the plugin panel.\n5. Click or drag an icon to insert it onto your canvas.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Extensive Library**: Access over 1,500 free icons and the full Pro collection.\n- **Visual Customization**:\n    - **Size**: Adjust from 16px to 512px.\n    - **Color**: Set primary and secondary colors with opacity control.\n    - **Transform**: Rotate and flip icons horizontally or vertically.\n    - **Padding**: Toggle padding removal for precise alignment.\n- **Smart Search**: Quickly find icons by name or keyword.\n- **Favorites**: Save frequently used colors for consistency.\n\n## Pro Features\n\nUnlock the full potential of Boxicons with a Pro subscription:\n\n- **All Icon Packs**: Access Duotone, Duotone Mix, and Duotone Solid packs.\n- **Advanced Styles**: Use Rounded and Sharp corner styles.\n- **Multiple Weights**: Choose from Thin, Normal, and Bold stroke weights.\n\n### Activating Pro\n\n1. Subscribe to a Pro plan at [boxicons.com/pricing](https://boxicons.com/pricing).\n2. Retrieve your API token from your [Account Settings](https://boxicons.com/account/settings).\n3. In the plugin, click the **Pro User?** link.\n4. Paste your token and validate to unlock all features.\n\n## Icon Packs Overview\n\n| Pack | Description | Availability |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Basic** | Clean outline icons | Free (Regular/Normal) |\n| **Filled** | Solid shapes for emphasis | Free (Regular/Normal) |\n| **Brands** | Popular logos and trademarks | Free |\n| **Duotone** | Two-tone icons with depth | Pro |\n| **Duotone Mix** | Mixed style variations | Pro |\n| **Duotone Solid** | Solid two-tone variations | Pro |";
